# The image is built from the sources and build settings only. Anything else in a working copy (a local
# semantic-router.json, state database, secrets file, test output) stays out of the build context.
*
!src/
!deploy/third-party-notices.cs
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Build.targets
!Directory.Packages.props
!global.json
!nuget.config
!.editorconfig
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.secrets.json
**/semantic-router.json
